      'Color Connect move limit is tied to how many times you pick up a color to draw a pipe. Perfect play uses one stroke per color pair. The board is cleared only when every pair is connected without crossing and every square is covered. That means the challenge has two parts: make a valid route for each color and avoid unnecessary redraws that push your move count past the level’s budget.',
      '@image:0',
      '## What the game counts as a move',
