      'If the count stops changing, you may be making guesses that distinguish nothing in the current set. Revisit the candidates and choose another feature to test. If the count unexpectedly becomes difficult to reason about, the [Mastermind rules guide](/blogs/how-to-play-mastermind) explains the clue marks, and you can practise with [Code Breaker](/play/code).',
      '## Use hints and undo as learning tools',
